This project packages the locally developed v21-config-2 subtitle translation
pipeline and range-preserving capacity fix. It was motivated by compatibility
diagnostics involving DualSubs. It is an independent project, not an official
DualSubs or Netflix release. No DualSubs hosted scripts are needed at runtime.

Bundled third-party dependency:
opencc-js 1.4.2, https://github.com/nk2028/opencc-js
